{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And now</b> — because he saw that Israel had not repented, he feared that the evil would come upon them. Therefore he prayed: <b>take now my life</b>, in the manner of <b>blot me out, I pray</b>, and as Elisha did when he anointed Hazael."], :book :jonah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Jonah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=19&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:11.229346395Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}